      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. To make it a bit more engaging for the students, could you expand a little on the 'movement of ideas' part? Like, how did the actual routes and the merchants themselves act as the vehicle for this? Is there more to it than just people carrying items from point A to point B?",
